  "id": "spinach-with-pine-nuts",
  "name": "Spinach with Pine Nuts",
  "subtitle": "A quick savory green side with toasted pine nuts",
  "description": "Wilted spinach is finished with olive oil, garlic, toasted pine nuts, and black pepper.",
